                                                          Business Question
How many transactions are fraudulent, what percentage of all transactions are fraudulent, and what is the total transaction value associated with fraud?
                  
                          
                    Query
SELECT
    COUNT(*) AS total_transactions,
    SUM(amount) AS total_transaction_value,
    SUM(CASE
        WHEN fraud = 1 THEN 1
        ELSE 0
    END) AS fraudulent_transactions,
    ROUND(
        SUM(CASE  WHEN fraud = 1 THEN 1
            ELSE 0  END) * 100.0 / COUNT(*),
        2  ) AS fraud_rate,
    ROUND(
        SUM(CASE  WHEN fraud = 1 THEN amount
            ELSE 0  END),2 ) AS fraudulent_transaction_value
FROM fraud_detection_data;


                                                               INSIGHT:
The dataset contains 594,643 transactions, of which 7,200 were identified as fraudulent transactions , which had a fraud rate of 1.21% and approximately $3.82M in fraudulent 
transaction value

                                       
